sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Customer

    participant App as Customer App
    participant API
    participant Product
    participant Order
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Queue as BullMQ
    participant Notification

    Customer->>App: Browse Products

    App->>API: GET /products

    API->>Product: Load Products
    Product->>DB: Query Products
    DB-->>Product: Product List

    Product-->>API: Products
    API-->>App: Product List

    Customer->>App: Place Order

    App->>API: POST /orders

    API->>Order: Create Order

    Order->>DB: Save Order
    DB-->>Order: Order Saved

    Order->>Queue: Publish Order Created Event

    Queue->>Notification: Notify Vendor

    Notification-->>Queue: Delivered

    Order-->>API: Order Created

    API-->>App: 201 Created